    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:173841b44b959fdc5bca80d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我背后的锚可以拿来装名片。很棒吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74b7b42fe00b15b07bd7f56dd636e0c3440b7eecaf99e47d7dea75f37d5c77ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd254cef1d7ce1f9e0fb866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3736e2b19918f66f811fb59e149eefb4f1f24b806cc5f5c51962180de44d37cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:884662eb147a31851af0734b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放马过来吧…\r\n如果你想成为\r\n最强炒面卖家的话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0a52ebbb6ce17351115483c604afbbbddc7d4af83a822b2706744355bc0e801",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3ee304b0f2bb425f785bd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下集！小金船的实力！！\r\n敬请期待！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3402d568221d5551e3414ce08350323a25108fe0c8e2a16f21ad0dc925ef6869",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32b18fd5d8a3a119796c577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\n早上的抛球射门，\n要开始喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35720b375964552caf16cd33f0b5d99a8eb8807e9f657e4eba8f2bafe56cb895",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8baee70eabbd7fcb3706d09a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要一起活下去…\n在这叫做地球的，\n竞技场上…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62473ce98e613559105194f222d9efb89b7434b8448be3e30c0ba7c4b835d433",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55c95efa2ad45885d32d12b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Peace～Peace☆不陪我玩的话\n你拥有的所有圆珠笔，\n都会被拆掉☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "144ef0d2f7541cfa1407edc84a7494f511513588bd17feaa52bf7004f119b8d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbafd7616711e8eb473a38c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『肚子的状况』和『巴拉奎』\n很像对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c688ee5b6ec87257fb09b8bdd0eeb672914898d6bad6b583206954209aa4c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b1b225e4b288e466346a9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "困了的话就喝咖啡吧～？\n用辣椒油代替牛奶，\n我・来・帮・你放进去吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fef44c74139fca83c981e79acc1c06adb6c5d416620d357c14fb1ecd4965e795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e62bcd07b5c3a8dada2844ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噶！！\n在脑内开始玩抢椅子游戏，\n太兴奋睡不着了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e11ccf5869391cc700ca328bd6f97a241616df08d3535d2a8233f6b720198894",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:907165f01e55a2d80b6b94ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天真不错啊。气氛高涨起来了，\n低下头来观察樱花吧，\n哦吼吼吼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e93e6a5064dcc68b8538c20113fad77f57223b9540204558273ff444db9096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d0b688a8967e49d24c636d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去抓虫子吧！\n稍微去一下菲律宾吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb27dcfd04b4c5cf22020e64543e21e6175e3b3b8d6c2b6fffb84596efff37d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9df5188c1f8e516d5e244a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这只蟋蟀跑进了屋子，\n所以给它起了叫『波奇』的名字。\n今天也过得不错啊，波奇…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1f7c35d75f4acaffcc58a82ccf63bf3091177c0bfedc750555b3202715c4a08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:420172b8c66094904b510445",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～，里面有穿\n防弹背心代替内衬…这样\n不管是下鱼叉还是下鲭鱼都能放心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0925d5a0de22ad219cb3b120a4ba52a2c5c86931d8aaf84457aee0a7ddaa87ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d56ad037908df8d750cbf78b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿船占卜时间！\r\n我看看训练员今天的运势……\r\n……什么！？真假……哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "28e112d5bd059a5435fd276c9592092bf6738cbb9737c0551625b34c42e63fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e151dc5dd6cbf508ab88a48b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨还真认真啊，\r\n每天早上都乖乖来报到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85788e9069559a52058932332826340a59f3a8aa3e881a72c16c6ebe6907628f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bc9b14d37e71e7fa32f770",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天起你见到人都要用\r\n「训训～☆」来打招呼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "042dd8aaaf520438c2b56f79f8a57733f2b13db4ed235922c26acbbf5cca2649",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39f20c965ba2b36513ef9ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候我的头发原本是褐色的，\r\n自从某天把糯米粉洒在头上后\r\n就变成现在这样了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9070baac1f378ff222f71a7d11c46acf0cf13843c4f7e862d5f5f1a7a752f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3fb6c66617f1d1f1677271",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……糟糕，我骗米浴\r\n积雨云是巨大棉花糖，\r\n结果她到现在还相信耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f830dbde5da87042e951800475f63dfa16f38f03bd8c8aeb66d7547462c4ed9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3b818819f0f2837988e963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我听清楚了～\r\n记得用口红在窗户上\r\n写下「西瓜」后再睡喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1126ed7d02aa89840dde2036a856c1e5d06d54b6a42cece3421437959d437503",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd6866de2decb95839cce1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……呼……！成功了！\r\n看这华丽的金色花瓣！\r\n正是新品种樱花「金船满开」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a3abfb6cfd0fe1cdf51382ae37e92f2e36e70bfb02fb228d40813f78f76407",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1932e4c8c4829fb385dd7b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？\r\n太平洋的海浪是两人座喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e5708bdd667a55b89ec05a853903d976346abdcd03bd4877b11d4ba3003076",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7881baaa2d9ae3826c16e0f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吶～你有大台的吸尘器吗～？\r\n我想拿去挖番薯说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c92c39eeecb57cf7c70349e26aa85a2bfe2ed4c24bd0b6a15606d60e768645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc8cb0b54ea878565bab3d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啾！\r\n讨厌，忍不住打喷嚏了☆\r\n……你有在听吗喂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc0601b6917d9b78170a85cd53b829c55ef18590cb85abdd46441a597b3f352",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b4167d5fc0d518682057e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐DA☆ZE！",
      "source_fingerprint": "833f8c4d8d580a0807dc9c20e80c743b5af936dad2f2d4397a00cccfc3fea4b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3b40c12c9b0ca6f33ae55d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐DA☆ZE！",
      "source_fingerprint": "833f8c4d8d580a0807dc9c20e80c743b5af936dad2f2d4397a00cccfc3fea4b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9c24963f34954c35b75378",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用法文腔说早安！……太小声了！\r\n这样是无法走跳巴黎的！\r\n大声点，早安！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc2b06d283a29d74413aa5a173c92a9e329f39dda16671dbfa56e4ea708b6a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2fbe94a725fb66fe12724de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶～！要是脖子再长个20米\r\n就不会迟到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94f9a66fcb07b41d3b0ceb00b7d0b6ffd4c4afc9e3944574192c3d2fb94ce1e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12de4feb391b7d04164eb228",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起始姿势……像这样～～！学螃蟹\r\n横着走，然后边走边吃螃蟹！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f677af036e609e09730c22353a4e5270b7a59a77ed0cd3be96c932f1d12c309c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba582c945297f222c46aa535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去森林散散步促进消化吧～！\r\n别担心啦。\r\n我会负责护卫你的☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d231217d20f463c9c56dc9dd52361bc0084dbab9d46ffb5cac6903c14fd4560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af958a43b5a0ae771b3f43c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你吃马卡龙时\r\n会加进沾面吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17c6340c0e9dab949e928ff6888a7b5c4717b2743a2ca2fe93fdb191348e7667",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:321c074633110c8ef3cf4368",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗨，明天早上也要模仿对吧？\r\n艾菲尔铁塔的姿势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9bc13947ee06cf25a6237a1c20fb8e2a80b1051dd8b144d693c1e9d0882f51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf71da942ad7928a4b50cd2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用芦笋当枕头\r\n会睡到落枕。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e956772fcfa2b1405abda36b4b0259fc20490c4faabc84222ca67a5955ff07ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e2adde8a2a5cd9f7f62564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不得了……让蜗牛帮忙写的\r\n阅读感想竟然得奖了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8621058088976d4ba4caf7b96d0c677ce0a6834c091a471c9dd5751202d14c40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49327caf9bc47a78e9c36f00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要向小鹰解释在日本怎么欣赏\r\n掉满地的红叶。你负责当叶子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03bd87e4f81bdc0d98cc99dd38d0ca2c0fc586264d8f5905066ed4d30b0e8b70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8dbbb3d1d7c2a05b8a3ddc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是会冷\r\n就把手伸进中山的毛帽里吧！\r\n会觉得臼齿暖洋洋喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43a16c35421ca3c1d564d046bee980bc8d33b5d1b454810e4f6fe4ad1f8a742",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41b426519922005ee4e1774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "086716d23d171a0e11fe0fafe5953f29f71625dd67015137bea8ebd7d5345589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bfaff80c353bb983357efeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在起跑的闸门里真心不自在的不行啊！\n为什么不安排上\n可以自己一脚踹开的系统啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "79484ea6ab5b545294c896afadc8c504527d911a42e01908053f066fd94a8b59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b54467ad379e3c513230d020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "问麦昆『要组建乐队吗？』\n马上就被拒绝了。是比起\n巴拉莱卡琴更喜欢曼陀林琴吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec4611cd1d038b910eb00b0a25d6b86091ad362f43faf33ccb605fa71545c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00bc03f613ee495dfd4f670a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我偷偷往荣进闪耀的\n存钱罐里放了5日元。\n那家伙大概一瞬间就会注意到吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db77759e7142d943ce331fb05a636315999260d21c5e40e8f6ca5ecbb8889eec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ede8b18466d56ea782b5103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "透过保鮮膜眺望远处的天空。\n就能看到老夫的故乡——ゴルゴル星\n…哦嚯嚯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fde8aa93e1b7c741e5f5635a9b56736abeb6c7ed106fe2223b1273a035a8f74c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ace8f4af32c5c4c65acabc7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道在球体上挖洞，\n做成甜甜圈的一种兼职吗？\n那个真的很厉害啊，虚无感…",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc35740d431615edfb7e7766644bbb86cb4a3736ce20c2feb2f93b031cd4c2cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182288e9bc78243ca24f8c61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌，下摆飘飘然\n好害羞呜哇—////\n…喂你倒是看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17808eaa566bbc0fa8a09909adf4f9ddd056a90127a9672b48a8f4a772bce37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cce514fdf98291c6c5ae38b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台即为大地，我即是风…\n我会为你带来华丽的\n现代舞蹈哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "477c8a99d7ff39175b07d6cc00354b9065d266586b2d0a4f11b65c33dd07c0c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe6e4ae24fa7d096c94e92a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赤红・炽热・\n小金船登场！把世界\n染成一片通红吧—！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b81b0e03c855c193e77c963b1564dd53be0c7cde92be37df4048f87f869b09e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb3f8ee377527601d72ebc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啦，找伦家有什么事的说？\n如果是法国的巴黎时装展\n那个已经拒绝了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4362958600835ec604e7a4e2cc84cc047a3c55a2788354e7bb70177d2d08040",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad87c4a1b51f0aa1c4142a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊～，清爽的早晨…这样的早晨\n对于佐敦那家伙啊～\n用套索踢击代替寒暄吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8af323d2ae67b900b62142d53927831f7d45a411b756829a9f09ed8a5019653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02124615c0e59237f04369aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴那家伙，怎么吃了面包…\n啊呀，那是什么主张啊…！？\n是要和自己唱反调吗…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "40ecd8923f53d5b393361971410ad15210fbba5833d83d27a2a00c908e6395f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00701c0a486fad03cec16028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，到了《醇厚羅刹飯》的时间了。\n今天才能完成吗，\n终极的醇厚关东煮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43a388ca5afd65bbc156eeb20b72cc3f1a6ab98623c480843799178ae47f90b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ca9687e2673048cf337f76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气转暖了，和小矮子们\n去外面玩吧～。小孩子\n对我来说挺有意思所以蛮喜欢的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eedc9d939d1f8c69546a6a8e1bcc56b0710ccb30fe945525eac395c5c427da5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b5e401ab478496ef78ddac3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎光临！！\n现在这个时期推荐\n不加鳗鱼的鳗鱼饭哦！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8894fdc6bcf1601935529f40d6a801d1d878b6fef8964ffed50acb07233d9dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8743c324c12cf2dcbe96d7e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "讨厌～，总觉得有点干燥☆\n不好好保湿的话★\n漂亮的皮肤就要变粗糙了～☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3c8381b9ba42312ded3c87694d02abe73cb3969f3eac5b03fca3ed19439f79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1007",
        "91014"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
